{"id":395,"name":"Candy Candy","slug":"candy_candy","synopsis":"This story is about a girl, Candy, who is a orphan. She is a nice and optimistic girl and she has a warm heart. When she was a child, she lived in an orphanage called Pony's Home. She had a good friend called Ann. And she met the \"handsome boy on the hill\" who is a important person in her life, on the hill behind the orphanage.\n\nShe was adopted by the Loka's family. What's awaiting her are the bad-hearted Leo and his sister, Eliza. One day, in the rose garden, she met a boy, who is identical to the \"handsome boy on the hill\" who she had met in her childhood. The boy is called Antony. Thereafter, a fantastic story that she has never expected begins.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":1976,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:35","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 00:51:00","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":2800},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":2800},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":2556},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":1913},{"site":"ANN","externalId":545},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":2169}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":789,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/Tt7NU6R0q19prkV6MKAueakEyIUtixJ00WkC00JR.jpg"},{"id":790,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/OA2Zl3hDOKKw5d00cb5zwBnsFqQyEgnHgeNFSHbg.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":38,"name":"Toei Animation","slug":"toei_animation"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":53,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":53,"title":"Candy Candy","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":57,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":12332,"basename":"CandyCandy-OP1.webm","filename":"CandyCandy-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/CandyCandy-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":18288418,"resolution":480,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"VHS","tags":"480","audio":{"id":10211,"basename":"CandyCandy-OP1.ogg","filename":"Cand